IMPORT `nd67-art12-duties-workdays`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Chapter I (general provisions), as far as the motor chapter needs it;
-- and the transitional and commencement provisions that decide which vintage governs a
-- contract (Article 76(1) and 77(1) of Decree 67; Article 9 and 10 of Decree 220/2026).
-- Quotations (`src:`) are printed by tools/vnsrc.py; see the nouns module for the key.
--
-- WHAT DECREE 220/2026 DOES TO THIS CHAPTER. Its Article 9(1) replaces "người thứ ba" with
-- "bên thứ ba" in Article 3(5); its Article 9(2) replaces "hoạt động đầu tư xây dựng" with
-- "hoạt động xây dựng" in Articles 1, 2, 3(5)(b) and 4(5)(c), 4(6)(b), which are the
-- construction limbs this row does not encode. Nothing else here is amended (NOTES.md §1.2).

