-- (5)(a) The third party, for the motor insurance: a person whose health, life or property
-- the vehicle damaged, except the driver, the persons on the vehicle, the passengers on that
-- very vehicle, and the owner unless the owner had handed possession and use of the vehicle
-- to another. Point (b) is the construction insurance's third party, outside this row.
--
-- THE TWO VINTAGES. As made, the term is "người thứ ba". Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
-- replaces it with "bên thứ ba" in this clause (and in Articles 5, 7(1)(a), 10(2)(đ), 12(2),
-- 12(6)(a) and 13(5)), and changes no other word of the definition. Each vintage answers from
-- its own text below; the two texts define the same persons (NOTES.md §1.2, fork F2).
