GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
GIVETH A STRING
`the term for the third party in` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023 as made`                        THEN "người thứ ba"
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023 as amended by Decree 220/2026`  THEN "bên thứ ba"

GIVEN p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`not one of the persons Article 3(5)(a) excepts` p a MEANS
        NOT p's `driving the vehicle`
    AND NOT p's `on the vehicle`
    AND NOT p's `a passenger on the vehicle`
    AND NOT (    p's `the owner of the vehicle`
             AND NOT a's `the owner had handed possession and use of the vehicle to another`)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 3(5)(a); Decree 220/2026 Article 9(1)
GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023 as made`                        THEN `not one of the persons Article 3(5)(a) excepts` p a
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023 as amended by Decree 220/2026`  THEN `not one of the persons Article 3(5)(a) excepts` p a

