--
-- WHICH DATE DECIDES (fork F1). Both transitional clauses speak of contracts "đã giao kết trước
-- ngày ... có hiệu lực": the date of CONCLUSION decides, not the date of the accident or of
-- the claim. An accident on 1 August 2026 under a contract concluded on 30 June 2026 is
-- answered from the decree as made.
`the day Decree 67/2023 took effect` MEANS YMD 2023 9 6
`the day Decree 220/2026 took effect` MEANS YMD 2026 7 1

@ref Decree 67/2023 Articles 76(1), 77(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(1)-(2)
GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A `The rules that govern a contract`
`the rules that govern` c MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF c's `concluded on` AT LEAST `the day Decree 220/2026 took effect`
            THEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` `Decree 67/2023 as amended by Decree 220/2026`
        IF c's `concluded on` AT LEAST `the day Decree 67/2023 took effect`
            THEN CONSIDER c's `amended by agreement to apply`
                 WHEN JUST v  THEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` `Decree 67/2023 as made`
        OTHERWISE
                 CONSIDER c's `amended by agreement to apply`
                 WHEN JUST v  THEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023`

-- Every rule that answers a contract's question starts here. A contract Article 76(1) leaves
-- under the earlier rules is declined: those rules are the law's answer, but they are not in
-- this encoding's sources.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 76(1): Decree 03/2021/NĐ-CP and the other earlier rules are not in the sources
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model` MEANS
    REFUSE "a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model"

GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
`the vintage that governs` c MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rules that govern` c
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v THEN v
    WHEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023`
        THEN `a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model`
